# Rodel - Unified Social Visit & Inland Curiosity Timeline
# Voice: Courteous, slightly formal Ilokano Litao water anito. Zero time-of-day words. Zero em-dashes.

label Greeting
if {Transaction_HasReactiveOpener}:
	Rodel: {Transaction_ReactiveOpener}
if {Transaction_VisitVar} < 34:
	Rodel: Dayu-dayu, keeper. Stepping out of the sun to rest beneath your awning.
	Rodel: Strange how concrete holds heat long after river stones would have cooled.
elif {Transaction_VisitVar} < 67:
	Rodel: Just passing up from the creek bamboo, keeper. Your counter stays remarkably orderly.
	Rodel: Inland folk hang sachets in neat rows like drying fishing nets. Quite clever.
else:
	Rodel: No errand this pass, keeper. Only paying polite respect to a welcoming threshold.
	Rodel: The wind off the creek almost smelled like northern salt earlier.
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Smalltalk
if {Transaction_VisitVar} < 34:
	Rodel: Good shade beneath your roof. I shall return to the bamboo bank now.
elif {Transaction_VisitVar} < 67:
	Rodel: Always a quiet pleasure observing inland trade. Take care, keeper.
else:
	Rodel: Dayu-dayu, keeper. May your shelves stay full and your road calm.
[end_timeline]
